# On-screen controls on the platform's own layout (RIFT_START=stage): the joystick aims up-right while FIRE is held,
# and a third finger jumps. Touches go through the same hit testing as fingers (InputScript "touch"); used by the
# phone checks.
120 capture touch_start.png
130 touch 1 stick 0.7 -0.7
135 touch 2 fire
170 touch 3 jump
180 capture touch_aim.png
185 lift 3
230 lift 2
230 lift 1
260 capture touch_end.png
280 quit
